      Sturmian infimum (golden slope)    mu_S = 1.86676
      L=2                                mu_S = 2.00000
      silver L=1+sqrt2                   mu_S = 2.13224
      L=3                                mu_S = 2.30278
      the map (every 3x+r, mu <= log2 3 = 1.585) does not move it; only the word class does.
